{
  "slug": "preset-toolkit",
  "name": "Preset Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Dashboard management toolkit for Preset/Superset — sync, validate, push, screenshot, visual regression, ownership",
  "longDescription": "Ships **21 skills**, **2 agents** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (21): `preset` (Preset dashboard management router — sync, push, validate, screenshot, visual regression, ownership), `preset-brainstorming` (Dashboard change brainstorming -- understand business intent, map to technical changes, preview impact), `preset-chart` (List, inspect, query, pull, and push individual Preset charts), `preset-checkpoint` (Daily checkpoint: pull, validate, screenshot, visual diff, and generate summary report), `preset-code-review` (Review checklist for Preset dashboard changes -- verify safety, correctness, and completeness), `preset-dashboard` (List, inspect, and pull individual Preset dashboards), `preset-dataset` (List, inspect, query, pull, and push individual Preset datasets), `preset-debugging` (Systematic debugging for Preset dashboard issues with known failure modes and fixes), and 13 more\n- **Agents** (2): `conflict-check-agent`, `visual-diff-agent`\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install preset-toolkit@claude-community` from `rishav1305/preset-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 21,
    "agent": 2,
    "hook": 1
  },
